              "count": 43,
              "added": false,
              "removed": false,
              "value": "1.  Sign in to the **Microsoft Teams admin\ncenter**.\n2.  Select Meetings > Live events policies.\n3.  Select Global (Org-wide default) policy.\n4.  Set Record an event to "
            },
            {
