              "value": " or Never record"
            },
            {
              "count": 93,
              "added": false,
              "removed": false,
              "value": "\n5.  Click Save.\n6.  If custom policies were created, repeat these steps for each\npolicy, selecting the appropriate policy in step 3.\nSteps for the unmanaged users are outlined in Manage chat with external Teams users not managed by an organization (https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoftteams/manage-external-access#manage-chat-with-external-teams-users-not-managed-by-an-organization)."
